%% DB Hive - Sequence diagram: Save Query + LLM Suggestion Flow
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as AppAPI
  participant LLM as LLMAdapter
  participant DB as Postgres

  U->>FE: Click Save + Request Suggestion
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/saved-queries {visual_spec, requestSuggestion=true}
  API->>DB: create SavedQuery - pending suggestion
  API->>LLM: request suggestion - redacted spec
  LLM-->>API: suggestion (diff or recommended changes)
  API-->>FE: suggestion available
  U->>FE: Accept suggestion
  FE->>API: PATCH /api/v1/saved-queries/:id {applySuggestion: true}
  API->>DB: update SavedQuery.visual_spec
  API-->>FE: 200 OK {savedQuery}
